{
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "noellesroles:the_insane_damned_paranoid_killer",
      "tab": "ROLE",
      "sourceModId": "noellesroles",
      "nameKey": "announcement.role.the_insane_damned_paranoid_killer",
      "summaryKey": "guidebook.sparkassist.content.role.overview",
      "pages": [
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "quote",
              "text": "我能听见死者的悲鸣……"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "杀手阵营的情报位。你能听见死者说话，从亡魂的闲聊里套出情报。"
            },
            {
              "type": "section",
              "text": "能力",
              "tone": "danger"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "runs": [
                {
                  "text": "亡者之声",
                  "tone": "danger"
                },
                {
                  "text": "：已经死亡的玩家在你附近说话时，你也能听见，听得到的距离和普通语音一样。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "section",
              "text": "玩法建议",
              "tone": "good"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "text": "死者能看到所有人的身份，聊天时常会说出谁是警职、谁杀了谁。别急着走开，留心听附近的亡魂在说什么。"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "text": "把听来的身份信息告诉同伴，优先解决警职和调查类身份。"
            },
            {
              "type": "section",
              "text": "需要注意",
              "tone": "danger"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "text": "别把听到的内容说漏嘴：你知道了不该知道的事，很容易暴露身份。"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "亡语杀手默认不会出现在对局中。",
              "tone": "muted"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "ownerRoleIds": [],
      "requiredModIds": [
        "noellesroles"
      ],
      "color": "#FF0000",
      "order": 330
    }
  ]
}
